cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, cite the repository and the commit used."
title: "Quantum adiabatic theorem in Lean"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: N-Y-L
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of the finite-dimensional spectral-subspace quantum
  adiabatic theorem, with supplied smooth Hamiltonian and orthogonal
  spectral-projection paths, a uniform spectral gap, and an operator-norm
  leakage estimate of C/T.
